title: Atelier 1.0.0 shipped broken on a fresh install; fixed in 1.0.1 and 1.0.2
summary: 'A fresh npm install of the 1.0.0 CLI found render, studio/init in v2 workspaces, the workspace .gitignore and carousel recipes broken despite green tests. Fixed in 1.0.1 (PR #21, four review rounds), .purpose anchors repaired (PR #22), and a studio port-fallback 403 bug fixed in 1.0.2 (PR #23). Release verification is now a protocol.'
